threshold determines when a winner can be declared, making the comparison about verifiable results."}]]}],["$","div","Solo Sandbox · 1 agent",{"className":"feature","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Solo Sandbox · 1 agent"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"One agent operates without a goal, opponent, or score. This is the observation baseline: what happens when an agent is given an environment and unstructured time?"}]]}],["$","div","Builder · 1–3 agents",{"className":"feature","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Builder · 1–3 agents"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Agents work toward a verifiable objective in a real workspace. Code and builds provide feedback, and the run ends when the goal check passes or the budget is exhausted."}]]}],["$","div","Society · 3–8 agents",{"className":"feature","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Society · 3–8 agents"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Several agents inhabit a shared world with scarce resources. Their exchanges, agreements, and emerging institutions become the subject of the experiment."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"how-it-works","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-marker","children":"How it works"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"From idea to action."}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"workflow","children":[["$","li","Start the local environment",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"step-number","aria-hidden":"true","children":["0",1]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Start the local environment"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Run Docker Desktop, then use START_AGENT_ARENA.cmd from the repository to launch the dashboard and local bridge."}]]}]]}],["$","li","Set up the experiment",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"step-number","aria-hidden":"true","children":["0",2]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Set up the experiment"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Choose an arena and agent count. Give each participant a provider, model, and its own credentials. Set the objective, evidence markers, and action permissions."}]]}]]}],["$","li","Observe and intervene",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"step-number","aria-hidden":"true","children":["0",3]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Observe and intervene"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Follow activity and outcomes, respond to approval requests, or pause and terminate the run. Simulation mode offers a dashboard rehearsal without model calls or shell and browser actions."}]]}]]}]]}]]}],"$L15","$L16"]}]]}]
